      </div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#2B2E2B]/85 via-[#2B2E2B]/45 to-transparent"></div>

      <div data-hero-content-wrap class="relative z-10 flex min-h-[calc(100svh)] flex-col justify-center px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-32 lg:min-h-[calc(100svh)] lg:px-[70px] lg:py-24">
        <div data-hero-content class="flex max-w-[621px] flex-col items-start gap-4">
          <p data-anim style="--d: 720ms" class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[4px] text-[#CCC8A8]">For Those Unspoken Words</p>
          <h1 class="flex flex-col gap-5 sm:gap-6">
            <span data-anim style="--d: 840ms" class="font-['Cormorant_Garamond'] text-4xl font-normal leading-[1.15] text-[#BCC6BC] sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl lg:leading-[87px]">Express your feelings beautifully...</span>
            <span data-anim style="--d: 960ms" class="font-['Cormorant_Garamond'] text-4xl font-semibold italic leading-[1.15] text-[#CCC8A8] sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl lg:leading-[87px]">...through flowers</span>
          </h1>
          <p data-anim style="--d: 1080ms" class="mt-1 max-w-[520px] text-sm font-normal leading-6 text-[#CCC8A8]/90 sm:text-xs">ANIA Flower Boutique is a means of expressing emotions through flowers. In today's fast-paced society, words are often lost when trying to express how we feel. For those unspoken words, the creations by the ANIA flower team offer a beautiful way to show care through the language of flowers.</p>
          <div data-anim style="--d: 1200ms" class="mt-2 flex w-full flex-col gap-3 sm:w-auto sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-6">
